e_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.poster.avif?t=1795213688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.webm?t=1795213688\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/b9197e61104c3f4a7b10d76c06c0a84a.mp4?t=1795213688\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythm Combat for all Skill Levels<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturne features an entirely skill based rhythm combat system.<br>With six difficulty options, Nocturne is suitable for beginners and veterans of the rhythm genre.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.poster.avif?t=1795213688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.webm?t=1795213688\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1374860\/extras\/a4767943a8842a9fe2cb69959932d10f.mp4?t=1795213688\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a huge variety of enemies and bosses with unique mechanics and unexpected twists.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks to land critical hits, but miss too many notes and enemies will attack you back. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/st